@startuml Sequence Diagram - Click Suggested Questions

actor "Customer" as Customer
participant "ChatView" as ChatView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Customer -> ChatView : 1 Open chat widget
activate ChatView
ChatView -> ChatView : 2 Display suggested questions

Customer -> ChatView : 3 Click suggested question
ChatView -> ClerkAuth : 4 Send question request
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 5 Store question
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 6 Update conversation record
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 7 Confirmation
ClerkAuth -> ChatView : 8 Success notification
ChatView -> Customer : 9 Display question sent

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate ChatView

@enduml
